<http://lblod.data.gift/id/data/ner-abb-flanders/v1.0.0> a airo:Data ;
  dcterms:title "NER training dataset for Flemish municipalities"@en ;
  dcterms:description "Dutch municipal decision documents from a range of Flemish municipalities (among them Kortrijk, Poperinge, Denderleeuw, Scherpenheuvel-Zichem and Zwevegem), annotated for named entities, document structure and document type. Annotated in Label Studio and exported with character-level spans left untouched — no BIO tagging, no tokenizer, no label grouping — so the data stays independent of any particular training setup."@en ;
  vcard:url "https://huggingface.co/datasets/lblod/abb-legal-ner-nl-flanders" .

<http://lblod.data.gift/id/data/ner-abb-multilingual/v1.0.0> a airo:Data ;
  dcterms:title "NER multilingual dataset"@en ;
  dcterms:description "Multilingual (English, Dutch, German) NER model for legal/administrative decision documents. This improved version adds native German training data (municipal decisions from Freiburg and Bamberg) on top of the original Dutch (Ghent) and English (translated) data, improving detection quality on German text and on text translated from German."@en ;
  vcard:url "https://huggingface.co/lblod/multilingual-ner-abb-improved" .

